  "summary": "字符串偶数下标为字母、奇数下标为数字；把每个数字替换为其前一个字母向后偏移该数字得到的字符。",
  "insight": "字符编码连续，奇数位置结果为 chars[i-1]+(chars[i]-0)。逐奇数下标原地替换。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "数字范围零到九",
    "偏移保证仍是小写字母",
    "偶数位置保持不变"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "odd-index-character-shift",
      "title": "奇数位字符偏移",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "直接按前一字母和当前数字计算替换字符。",
      "steps": [
        "chars=s.toCharArray",
        "i=1,3,5...",
        "chars[i]=(char)(chars[i-1]+chars[i]-0)，返回字符串"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(n)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/odd-index-character-shift/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/odd-index-character-shift/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/odd-index-character-shift/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
